# Ignore Visual Studio temporary files, build results, and
# files generated by popular Visual Studio add-ons.

## Build Folders
bin/
obj/
out/

## Visual Studio cache/options
.vs/
*.user
*.suo
*.userosscache
*.sln.docstates
*.VC.db

## Rider
.idea/
*.sln.iml

## NuGet
*.nupkg
*.snupkg
packages/

## DotNet and MSBuild
project.lock.json
project.fragment.lock.json
*.DotSettings.user

## Debug files
*.log
*.tlog
*.vspscc
*.vssscc

## Publish outputs
publish/
*.publishsettings

## Resharper
_ReSharper*/
*.DotSettings.user

## MonoDevelop
*.userprefs

## SQL Server files
*.mdf
*.ldf

## Visual Studio Code workspace settings
.vscode/

## Generated files
**/Generated/**

## Temporary
*.tmp
*.temp
*~

# Rider
.idea/
*.sln.iml

# OS generated files
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
